exports[`the Basic section, every element type > matrix, lists on both axes (page) 1`] = `
"div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-sm);"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "ID"
    input title="Rename element (Enter to commit, Esc to cancel)" style="flex: 1 1 0%; background: var(--bg-primary); cursor: text;" value="el"
    div data-stub="CopyButton" data-props="{\\"value\\":\\"el\\",\\"title\\":\\"Copy element ID\\"}"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Type"
    input readonly="" style="flex: 1 1 0%; opacity: 0.6; cursor: default; background: var(--bg-surface);" value="matrix"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Tag"
    input placeholder="optional" style="flex: 1 1 0%;" value=""
  div style="font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 11px); color: var(--text-muted); margin: -4px 0px 4px 0px;"
    "A macro this control runs reads it as"
    code
      "$trigger.tag"
    ", so a row of buttons can share one macro instead of needing one each."
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Label"
    input style="flex: 1 1 0%;" value=""
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "From device"
    button type="button" title="Fill the sources, destinations and route keys in from what the driver declares" style="flex: 1 1 0%; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: var(--border-radius); border: 1px dashed var(--accent); background: rgba(138, 180, 147, 0.08); color: var(--accent); font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer;"
      "Set up again from a device…"
  div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0px 0px 0px 76px;"
    "3"
    "sources and"
    "3"
    "destinations are written out. Re-open this to rename, reorder or pick up new ports."
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Style"
    select style="flex: 1 1 0%;" value="crosspoint"
      option value="crosspoint"
        "Crosspoint Grid"
      option value="list"
        "List (Dropdowns)"
      option value="tiles"
        "Tiles (One Card Per Destination)"
  div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0px 0px 0px 76px;"
    "Sources are set as a list of"
    "3"
    "entries, each with its own value. The count and key fields do not apply."
  div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0px 0px 0px 76px;"
    "Destinations are set as a list of"
    "3"
    "entries, each with its own value and route key. The count and key fields do not apply."
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Audio Readout"
    input type="checkbox" checked=true
    span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);"
      "Name the audio source when it differs from the video"
  div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0px 0px 0px 76px;"
    "Read from the device, per destination. Turn it off when the device keeps audio with the video: what it reports then is left over from the last time audio was switched separately, and naming it on the panel is wrong. Matrix Setup puts it back."
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Audio Follow"
    input type="checkbox" checked=false
    span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);"
      "Route audio with video"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Show Lock"
    input type="checkbox" checked=true
    span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);"
      "Lock buttons per destination"
  div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--color-warning); padding: 0px 0px 0px 76px; font-style: italic;"
    "Without a variable, a lock is only remembered by the panel that set it: it is forgotten when the page redraws, and no other panel sees it."
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Show Mute"
    input type="checkbox" checked=false
    span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted);"
      "Mute buttons per output"
  div style="margin-top: 4px;"
    div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 4px;"
      "Presets"
    div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;"
      button style="padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: var(--border-radius); border: 1px dashed var(--border-color); background: transparent; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; align-self: flex-start;"
        "Add Preset"
    div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; margin-top: 2px;"
      "Presets appear as buttons above the matrix. Each runs a macro when clicked."
  div style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-top: 6px; padding-bottom: 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);"
    "Matrix Appearance"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Active Color"
    div data-stub="InlineColorPicker" data-props="{\\"size\\":\\"md\\",\\"clearable\\":true,\\"value\\":\\"\\"}"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Inactive Color"
    div data-stub="InlineColorPicker" data-props="{\\"size\\":\\"md\\",\\"clearable\\":true,\\"value\\":\\"\\"}"
  div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-sm);"
    label style="width: 72px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--text-secondary);"
      "Cell Size"
    input type="number" placeholder="Auto" min="24" max="80" style="flex: 1 1 0%;" value=""
    span style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted);"
      "px"
  div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0px 0px 0px 76px;"
    "Blank sizes the crosspoints to the element, between 44 and 72px. A number pins them."
